.vscode/
.claude/
data_sets/*
!data_sets/target_leagues.json

# Per-deployment state, NOT source. betting_config.json carries live lane
# bankroll balances that the running web UI rewrites on every settlement;
# team_mappings.json is appended by EntityResolver as it resolves new clubs.
# Tracking them made every `git status` dirty and made merges dangerous — a
# merge to main on 2026-09-18 would have written a stale branch snapshot of the
# bankrolls over live ones while the server held the file open.
# Both ship as templates and are seeded on first use by
# ml_project/config_bootstrap.py (also runnable directly).
!data_sets/betting_config.template.json
!data_sets/team_mappings.template.json
# Standings spider URL list — live copy is gitignored (local edits OK);
# template is tracked so a fresh clone can seed it.
!data_sets/standings_form_flashscore_direct_links.template.csv

# D4 Paso 4 — referee history catalog (see docs/enriched_match_data_roadmap.md).
# Live corpus grows from a MatchHistory backfill + daily verification append
# (scripts/referees/build_referee_history.py) and regenerates deterministically,
# so it stays local like the other caches above. `data_sets/*` already hides
# the whole referees/ directory; re-allow it explicitly so the templates below
# can be tracked.
!data_sets/referees/
data_sets/referees/*
!data_sets/referees/referee_matches.template.csv
!data_sets/referees/referees.template.json

